                <p>Above all available information on imports, other totals lost or destroyed during
                    Bolshevik regime.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>:</p>
                <p>The principal “<hi rendition="#italic">Other</hi>” exports were iron, chalk and
                    timber;</p>
                <p>“ “ “ imports harvesting and industrial machinery, commodities, textiles,
                    etc.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Present Goal Traffic:</hi> 60,000 to 85,000 poods per
                    week, for British and Russian Naval forces. (Best weeks before the war 1,850,000
                    to 2,000,000.)</p>
